  "Specification": "CarTalkPuzzle: A pure mathematical specification for computing solutions to the Car Talk puzzle. Given constants N (target weight) and P (number of pieces), defines Break (all sorted compositions of N into P integer pieces in 1..N), IsRepresentation (whether piece subsets S and T balance weight w given break B), IsSolution (whether B solves all weights 1..N), AllSolutions (all valid breaks), and ExpandSolutions (maps each solution/weight pair to the actual piece-value sets). Uses a RECURSIVE Sum operator and a LET block with helpers PiecesFor, Image, and SolutionFor.",
